{"id":23059,"name":"灼尽炼狱的新骸","rarity":5,"path":"Warlock","desc":"虚无命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"一刻，是水流涌动。躯体渐沉，坠入蓝渊的最深处。\\n一刻，是荒芜孤岛，往昔的声音自云雾中回荡，飘远，再飘远。\\n一刻，是火红的彼岸花原，残锋自烈火中灼烧、重塑，最终归合为一。\\n\\n<i>「既然时日未到，便再造一新。」</i>\\n绝境为炉，此身为引，他已不记得是第几次感受这般痛楚。\\n\\n<i>「我将以死为锤，也将…斩断宿命！」</i>\\n浴火新生的刹那，烈焰四散开来，火光直冲天际，一路燃至彼岸尽头。\\n彼时，宿业尽数了断。那经由千锤百冶的新躯，已然熔铸而成。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23059,"name":"淬炼","desc":"使装备者的生命上限提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>，装备者回合开始时，固定恢复<unbreak>#2[i]</unbreak>点能量，该效果每个波次可触发1次。装备者施放战技攻击后，使目标陷入【炼狱】状态，持续<unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak>回合，【炼狱】状态下目标受到的暴击伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#4[i]%</unbreak></color>，受到来自装备者的暴击伤害额外提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#5[i]%</unbreak></color>。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.3,20,2,0.3,0.3]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.375,20,2,0.375,0.375]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.45,20,2,0.45,0.45]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.525,20,2,0.525,0.525]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.6,20,2,0.6,0.6]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":62.4,"hp_add":9.36,"attack_base":19.2,"attack_add":2.88,"defence_base":21,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":116001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":137.28,"hp_add":9.36,"attack_base":42.24,"attack_add":2.88,"defence_base":46.2,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110311,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":116001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":237.12,"hp_add":9.36,"attack_base":72.96,"attack_add":2.88,"defence_base":79.8,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110312,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":116002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":336.96,"hp_add":9.36,"attack_base":103.68,"attack_add":2.88,"defence_base":113.4,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110312,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":116002,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":436.8,"hp_add":9.36,"attack_base":134.4,"attack_add":2.88,"defence_base":147,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":60,"cost"